<title>USA: TENNIS-WEDNESDAY FEATURED MATCHES AT U.S. OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WEDNESDAY FEATURED MATCHES AT U.S. OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schedule of Wednesday's featured matches on the show courts at the U.S. Open (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Day session</p>
<p>Stadium court, beginning 11:00 am (1500 GMT)</p>
<p>15-Gabriela Sabatini (Argentina) v Ann Grossman (U.S.)</p>
<p>8-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.) v Henrieta Nagyova (Slovakia)</p>
<p>12-Todd Martin (U.S.) v Younes El Aynaoui (Morocco)</p>
<p>Grandstand:</p>
<p>9-Wayne Ferreira (South Africa) v David Nainkin (South</p>
<p>Africa)</p>
